From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psX workspace <psx@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amdgpu: program PS4 audio DTO during modeset

The Liverpool/Gladius DP-to-HDMI path does not run
dce_v8_0_afmt_setmode(), so dce_v8_0_audio_set_dto() never programs
DCCG_AUDIO_DTO0.  The HDA controller uses DTO0 as its 24 MHz reference;
the reset value leaves it at ~14.78 MHz and makes all audio run at
~0.61575x speed.

Program DTO0 from the active adjusted pixel clock in the PS4 modeset
path.  Hardware probe EXP-20261021-048 showed WALLCLK 14.778 MHz ->
23.942 MHz and a 10 s 48 kHz fixture 16.27 s -> 10.03 s with these
values.  Boot-tested in EXP-20261021-049 with the 7.2.11 kernel from
USB: DTO0 phase=24000, module=148500, WALLCLK 23.966476 MHz, and the
10 s fixture 10.0828 s (pre-fix 16.2586 s).  One boot; acoustic
validation pending.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/dce_v8_0.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/dce_v8_0.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/dce_v8_0.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/dce_v8_0.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/dce_v8_0.c
@@ -2551,6 +2551,7 @@ static int dce_v8_0_crtc_mode_set(struct drm_crtc *crtc,
 				  int x, int y, struct drm_framebuffer *old_fb)
 {
 	struct amdgpu_crtc *amdgpu_crtc = to_amdgpu_crtc(crtc);
+	struct amdgpu_device *adev = drm_to_adev(crtc->dev);
 
 	if (!amdgpu_crtc->adjusted_clock) {
 		/* v28: PS4 ATOM BIOS sometimes returns 0 from
@@ -2568,6 +2569,20 @@ static int dce_v8_0_crtc_mode_set(struct drm_crtc *crtc,
 	}
 
 	amdgpu_atombios_crtc_set_pll(crtc, adjusted_mode);
+
+	/* PS4: the DP->HDMI bridge path does not run afmt_setmode(), so the
+	 * audio DTO is never programmed.  The HDA controller uses DTO0 as its
+	 * 24 MHz reference; the reset value makes audio run at ~0.615x speed.
+	 * Program DTO0 from the active adjusted pixel clock here.
+	 */
+	if (adev->asic_type == CHIP_LIVERPOOL || adev->asic_type == CHIP_GLADIUS) {
+		WREG32(mmDCCG_AUDIO_DTO_SOURCE,
+		       (amdgpu_crtc->crtc_id <<
+			DCCG_AUDIO_DTO_SOURCE__DCCG_AUDIO_DTO0_SOURCE_SEL__SHIFT));
+		WREG32(mmDCCG_AUDIO_DTO0_PHASE, 24 * 1000);
+		WREG32(mmDCCG_AUDIO_DTO0_MODULE, adjusted_mode->clock);
+	}
+
 	amdgpu_atombios_crtc_set_dtd_timing(crtc, adjusted_mode);
 	dce_v8_0_crtc_do_set_base(crtc, old_fb, x, y);
 	amdgpu_atombios_crtc_overscan_setup(crtc, mode, adjusted_mode);
-- 
